# Galass — bugs found (test runs 1–5, 2026-10-18/19, Android 14 emulators, debug builds)

Severity: P0 = blocks core flow / safety · P1 = major · P2 = visible defect · P3 = cosmetic/minor.
"Cause" for run4 driver items: **PERM** = artefact of missing permission/config in the test, **REAL** = genuine app bug, **ENV** = emulator/test-environment.
Screenshots are in `/workspace/galass/`. Times UTC.

## Setup / build / config
| ID | Area | Sev | Issue | Expected vs actual | Evidence | Suspected file / fix |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| CFG-1 | Driver build | P1 | Linux/CI build fails: `route.dart` imports `screens/Profile/profile_screen.dart` but the folder is `profile/` (works only on case-insensitive macOS). | Builds on any OS; actual: compile error "Error when reading … No such file". Worked around with a local symlink (uncommitted). | `driver-build.log` (run1) | `Galass_Driver/lib/core/route/route.dart:7` → fix import case |
| CFG-2 | Firebase / GCP | P0 (debug/CI only) | Phone auth blocked for non-registered signing keys: `17499 Requests from this Android client application … are blocked` (403 GetAuthDomainTask). | Two separate places needed the debug SHA-1 `6D:97:52:…:11:A9`: Firebase app fingerprints **and** GCP "Android key (auto created by Firebase)" restrictions. **Fixed by Papa 00:00** (run4 OK). | `run3-driver-01-blocked.png`, logcat run3 | Document in SECURE_CREDENTIALS_SETUP.md |
| CFG-3 | Google Maps key | P1 (debug/CI) | Maps SDK `Authorization failure` → **blank maps** (driver home, rider ride map). Maps key in `AndroidManifest.xml` (`com.google.android.geo.API_KEY`) does not allow the box debug SHA-1. | Map tiles render; actual: beige empty map with Google logo. Same fix as CFG-2 but on the **Maps** key (and check "Maps SDK for Android" enabled). | `run5-driver-03-home.png`, `run4-driver-04-home.png`, `run4-rider-05-where.png` | GCP Credentials → Maps key → add `sn.galass.galassdriver` / `sn.galass.galassrider` + SHA-1 |
| CFG-4 | Builds | P3 | Repo gradle `jvmargs` −Xmx6–8G: OOM-kills the daemon on 15 GB/no-swap CI box; NDK 29 install race when building both in parallel. | — | run1 build logs | `android/gradle.properties` |

